  "prompt": "Cho hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>tan</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Vẽ đồ thị của hàm số đã cho.</li><li>Tìm các giá trị của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> sao cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>tan</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tìm các giá trị của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=